  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "• 835sqm (more or less) north facing site with sea views\r\n\r\n• Stormwater and Wastewater manholes - both on the site (fully completed and signed off by Watercare in 2023)\r\n\r\n• Mixed Housing Urban Zone providing many different development choices\r\n\r\n• Current weekly rent at $1,505 in total\r\n\r\n• Perfect for developer, family, investor or just land bank\r\n\r\nLocated on the prestigious St Heliers, this 835sqm (more or less) estate presents endless potential for income and development. The north-facing site is currently occupied by a two-level, four-bedroom residence and adjacent one-bedroom granny flat, both of which enjoy elevated sea and city views.\r\n\r\nPositioned for light and sun, the traditional main residence boasts solid construction. There are two living areas, four bedrooms and three bathrooms found across the two levels.  Next door, the modern granny flat has its own separate access and offers a light-filled lounge, kitchen, bathroom and bedroom on one level, with another space located downstairs (accessed externally). \r\n\r\nThe expansive site is flat, with a sweeping driveway arriving down to abundant off-street parking and four carports. Low-maintenance, well-established gardens frame the grounds, offering plenty of space to accommodate reimagined development and design concepts. Alternatively, the property is the ideal investment for garnering good rental income (weekly rent at $1505 in total), or perfect for those who seek close accommodation for extended family. \r\n\r\nThe sought-after location celebrates the classic Eastern Bays lifestyle. Family-friendly neighbourhoods are filled with parks and reserves, as well as a selection of excellent schools that cater to children of all ages. Popular St Heliers, Mission Bay and Kohimarama restaurants and cafes are all just a short drive from home.  \r\n\r\nThis is an incredible opportunity in an exceptional location.",
